---
import ComponentShowcase from '../components/ComponentShowcase'
import FoundationShowcase from '../components/FoundationShowcase'
import '../styles/global.css'
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="PzHown iOS 27 核心组件文档" />
    <title>PzHown UI · iOS 27 Components</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="components-page">
      <header class="components-page__header">
        <p class="hero-kicker">PZHOWN / CORE COMPONENTS</p>
        <h1>iOS 27 Components</h1>
        <p>这是新组件系统的唯一展示面。视觉以 ios27-design-system 为准，react-cupertino-ui 只用于 anatomy / 状态组织，Liquid Glass 只作为光学材质层。</p>
      </header>
      <ComponentShowcase client:load />
      <section class="lab-section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="hero-kicker">FOUNDATION / PRODUCT-READY</p>
            <h2>P0 Foundation Components</h2>
          </div>
          <p>补齐高频后台与公开站能力：导航、菜单、系统反馈、组合输入、日期、表格、分页与空状态。普通内容面保持 Grouped Surface，不为了展示效果滥用玻璃。</p>
        </div>
        <FoundationShowcase client:load />
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
